[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/comments/768798072","html_url":"https://github.com/iree-org/iree/issues/4633#issuecomment-768798072","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/4633","id":768798072,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDc2ODc5ODA3Mg==","user":{"login":"ScottTodd","id":4010439,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTA0Mzk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4010439?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScottTodd","html_url":"https://github.com/ScottTodd","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScottTodd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScottTodd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScottTodd/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScottTodd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScottTodd/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScottTodd/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScottTodd/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScottTodd/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScottTodd/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-01-28T04:51:43Z","updated_at":"2021-01-28T04:51:43Z","body":"I don't see that `vkDestroySemaphore` validation layer warning on my Windows machine with relatively up-to-date validation layers \r\n\r\n```\r\nλ vulkaninfo | grep validation\r\nVK_LAYER_KHRONOS_validation (Khronos Validation Layer) Vulkan version 1.2.162, layer version 1:\r\n                VK_EXT_validation_features : extension revision 2\r\n                        VK_EXT_validation_cache : extension revision 1\r\n```\r\n\r\nI do see this warning with `mnist_fake_weights.mlir` and `edge_detection.mlir` (and maybe others)\r\n\r\n> 51: E D:\\dev\\projects\\iree\\iree\\hal\\vulkan\\debug_reporter.cc:40] Validation Error: [ VUID-VkWriteDescriptorSet-descriptorType-0033